  "content": "<h3><strong>如果你有建議或任何問題要回報，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/TysonTheEmber/spelunkery_plus/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">GitHub</span></a></strong></h3><p><br>這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a> 的擴充模組，用於增加與其他模組的相容性</p><p><del>目前我們正在處理與其他模組中礦物的相容性</del></p><p>我目前沒有計劃進一步更新或支援此模組，你可以隨時提交 PR，我會負責審查</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必備模組：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonlight Lib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a></li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可選支援模組：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns and Chasms</a>（感謝 SkellaTex 允許我們使用並編輯來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gsoc-caverns-chasms-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GSOC: Caverns and Chasms Patch</a> 的資源）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mining-master\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mining Master</a>（感謝 Burning_Sulphur、IcyCaeli 和 Deadlydiamond98 允許我們使用來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunking-master\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunking Master</a> 的資源）</li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>計劃支援的模組：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n</ul><h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
